msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Åtgärder`: Aktivera funktionerna för :ref:`önskelista <ecommerce/"
"products/additional_features/wishlists>` och :ref:`produktjämförelse "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-comparison>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:102
msgid ""
"Choose how product :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attributes>` are displayed in the :guilabel:`Specification` section of the "
"product page:"
msgstr ""
"Välj hur produkt:ref:`attribut <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>` "
