#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:38
msgid ""
"Via :ref:`HTML tag <website/google_search_console/HTML-tag>` or :ref:`HTML "
"file <GSC-HTML-file-upload>`"
msgstr ""
"Via :ref:`HTML-tagg <website/google_search_console/HTML-tag>` "
"eller :ref:`HTML-fil <GSC-HTML-file-upload>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:40
msgid "Via :ref:`Google Tag Manager <analytics/google-tag-manager>`"
msgstr "Via :ref:`Google Tag Manager <analytics/google-tag-manager>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:41
msgid "Via :ref:`Google Analytics <analytics/google-analytics>`"
msgstr "Via :ref:`Google Analytics <analytics/google-analytics>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:44
msgid ""
"You can also verify your website's ownership from Google Merchant Center's "
"dashboard by navigating to :menuselection:`Settings --> Business Info` in "
"the left menu."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också verifiera din hemsidas ägarskap från Google Merchant Centers "
