"12564959?hl=en>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Merchant Center Hjälp <https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/"
"12564959?hl=en>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:56
msgid "Linking Odoo to GMC"
msgstr "Länka Odoo till GMC"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:59
msgid ""
"To use the :abbr:`GMC (Google Merchant Center)` integration in your Odoo "
"database, at least one :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` must "
"be assigned to the website."
msgstr ""
"För att använda :abbr:`GMC (Google Merchant Center)`-integrationen i din "
"Odoo-databas måste minst en :ref:`prislista <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"tilldelas hemsidan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:62
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll "
"to the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Merchant "
"Center`, and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Navigera till :menuselection:`Hemsida --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`, "
"rulla ner till avsnittet :guilabel:`Spårning & sökmotoroptimering`, "
"aktivera :guilabel:`Google Merchant Center` och :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:67
msgid ""
"By enabling the :guilabel:`Google Merchant Center` option, your website will "
"generate a dynamic `/gmc.xml` feed containing essential product information "
"and availability."
msgstr ""
"Genom att aktivera alternativet :guilabel:`Google Merchant Center` kommer "
"din hemsida att generera ett dynamiskt `/gmc.xml`-flöde som innehåller "
"viktig produktinformation och tillgänglighet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:70
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Manage feeds`."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Hantera flöden`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:71
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product Feeds` pop-up window, select a :ref:`pricelist "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, a :ref:`language <language/add>`, "
"and :ref:`categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`, "
"and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I popup-fönstret :guilabel:`Produktflöden`, välj en :ref:`prislista "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, ett :ref:`språk <language/add>` "
"och :ref:`kategorier <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`, "
"och :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:76
msgid ""
"You must first enable the corresponding :doc:`language </applications/"
"general/users/language>` in the website's settings and/or create "
"a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` in the foreign currency "
"with the :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` option "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Du måste först aktivera motsvarande :doc:`språk </applications/general/users/"
"language>` i hemsidans inställningar och/eller skapa en :ref:`prislista "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` i den utländska valutan med "
"alternativet :ref:`Valbar <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` "
"aktiverat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:81
msgid "Once done, click :guilabel:`Copy URL` on the corresponding feed."
msgstr ""
"När det är klart, klicka på :guilabel:`Kopiera URL` för motsvarande flöde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:82
msgid ""
"Go to the :abbr:`GMC (Google Merchant Center)` dashboard, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Products & store --> Products` tab in the left menu, and "
"click :guilabel:`Add products`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :abbr:`GMC (Google Merchant Center)`-dashboarden, navigera till "
"fliken :menuselection:`Produkter & butik --> Produkter` i vänstermenyn, och "
"klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till produkter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:85
msgid ""
"Choose :guilabel:`Add products from a file` and paste the URL of the copied "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Lägg till produkter från en fil` och klistra in URL:en för "
"den kopierade filen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/google_merchant_center.rst:88
msgid ""
