"not logged in, the quotation is assigned to the default *Public User* "
"contact."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Offert`: En produkt har :ref:`lagts till i varukorgen <ecommerce/"
"checkout/add-to-cart>`, men kunden har ännu inte slutfört :ref:`kassan "
