"pages/page_properties>`. Pages can be :ref:`duplicated <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`, "
"and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo låter dig :ref:`skapa <website/pages/page_creation>` olika typer av "
"webbsidor, inklusive med hjälp av :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publicera <website/pages/un-publish-page>` dem och "
"definiera deras struktur och synlighet genom att "
"konfigurera :ref:`sidegenskaper <website/pages/page_properties>`. Sidor "
"kan :ref:`dupliceras <website/pages/duplicate-page>`, :ref:`raderas <website/"
"pages/delete-page>` och :ref:`omdirigeras <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "Sidtyper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not change "
"dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, and "
"adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"**Statiska** sidor, såsom startsidan eller :ref:`anpassade <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` sidor, innehåller fast innehåll som inte ändras dynamiskt. "
"Du kan manuellt skapa dessa sidor, definiera deras URL:er och anpassa "
"deras :ref:`egenskaper <website/pages/page_properties>` efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a "
"new :doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. "
"Dynamic pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""
"**Dynamiska** sidor visar däremot innehåll som ändras automatiskt baserat på "
"data i databasen och användarinteraktion (t.ex. filtrering). De genereras "
"automatiskt av Odoo, till exempel när en app eller modul installeras (t.ex. "
"`/shop` eller `/blog`) eller när en ny :doc:`produkt <../../ecommerce>` "
"eller :doc:`blogginlägg <../../blog>` publiceras. Dynamiska sidor hanteras "
"annorlunda än statiska sidor."

