"results."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Indexerad`: Avaktivera om sidan inte ska visas i sökmotorresultat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:145
msgid ":guilabel:`Visibility`: Select who can access the page:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Synlighet`: Välj vem som kan komma åt sidan:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:147
msgid ":guilabel:`Public`: Everyone can access the page."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Offentlig`: Alla kan komma åt sidan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:148
msgid ":guilabel:`Signed In`: Only signed-in users can access the page."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Inloggad`: Endast inloggade användare kan komma åt sidan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Restricted Group`: Select the :doc:`user access group(s) </"
